		{
			dependencies: ["2C54677E1B38562F"]
			description: [
				"To kick off your playthrough, you must first hunt down the illustrious Void Blossom. With the Void Lily given to you in the previous quest, you can hunt down its location by following the pollen trail emitted by the flower. You &ocan&r go mine for diamonds and upgrade your gear before taking it on, but the boss is perfectly defeatable at iron level. Just be sure to set your spawn nearby, as it may take a couple attempts."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"P.S. After the fight, you may notice a strange rift appear. You can take this rift to your current spawn point, so if you set your spawnpoint with a bed, make sure to destroy it to return to world spawn!"
			]
			icon: "bosses_of_mass_destruction:crystal_fruit"
