		{
			dependencies: ["4CF416E3A1469824"]
			description: [
				"Iron's Spells n' Spellbooks is a mod that allows players to become combat mages! For the purposes of this modpack, we'll be constraining what spells you'll have access to, so please only use the spells that are tradable in the Timesavers section of the questbook."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"To get started, craft your first (and for this playtest, only) spellbook, the Flimsy Journal. Then you can inscribe the spells obtained by your quests into your book with the Inscription table. In order to cast spells, hold R to open your spell wheel, release it when it's hovering over your preferred spell, then press V to cast."
			]
