		{
			dependencies: [
				"0E6BB1B94F92D016"
				"2911541746862D7A"
			]
			description: [
				"Ever feel like your mobility during combat is rather lacking, but don't want to expend your valuable Enderpearls? Well, fret no longer, because in Oscillation, you can quickly automate a self-sufficient pearl farm! "
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"The key to this is the Proto Chorus, which can be crafted with 2 Menril Berries and 2 Enderpearls. You can then turn the Proto Chorus into a true Chorus Fruit by putting it through the Petal Apothecary, then turn a profit with the fruit by dunking it into a Mana Pool for 4 pearls!"
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"You technically don't need to engage with this automation aspect, but it's &ohighly recommended&r that you do so, as the following bosses can be rather painful without a way to relocate at a moment's notice."
			]
			id: "782AA563ECFBB4FB"
